      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:bgeqymeltxrtny34aikxe4vy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxowv46tdx2q",
      "text": "🆕 Leo Cullen has issued an injury update ahead of Saturday's Champions Cup opener against ASM Clermont Auvergne\n🔷 Jamison Gibson-Park, James Culhane and Joey Carbery will be further assessed with a decision on their availability to be made later in the week\n📰 See the update: https://bit.ly/3TTyauo",
